#: __init__.py:82
msgid "The thinness threshold to use when removing thin hulls. If set to default, the operator will only remove faces with an area that is lower than 1 percent of the average area of all faces"
msgstr "移除薄凸块时使用的薄度阈值。设为默认值时，操作符只会移除面积低于所有面平均面积 1% 的面"

